<title>PAKISTAN: Pak Suzuki Motor 1st half net 35 pct up.</title>
<headline>Pak Suzuki Motor 1st half net 35 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		3,445 vs 3,476</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     302 vs   228</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit    285 vs   210</p>
<p>    Interim dividend   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Pak Suzuki Motor Company Ltd. The company manufactures Suzuki cars, jeeps, wagon and some other vehicles of the same brand. The company has not announced any dividend therefore there is no book closure.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
